---
title: 子狐は人狼に襲撃されると死亡する (attack-immune trait を持たない)
setup: { kogitsune: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 3 }
rules:
  first-victim: none
---
# Day 1 投票で Dave (村) 処刑、 続いて Night 1 で Carol (狼) が Alice (子狐) を襲撃。
# 子狐は attack-immune を持たないため死亡、 cause=night_kill。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=子狐
!Bob=村人
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人
!Carol 1夜 襲撃 Alice

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Dave→Carol
Eve→Dave

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Dave 4 / Carol 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# night_kill: Alice
# == end ==

Day 2:

Bob→Carol
Carol→Bob
Eve→Carol

# == engine: Day 2 ==
# vote tally: Carol 2 / Bob 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Bob, Eve
# == end ==

# @expect-status Alice: dead
# @expect-cause Alice: night_kill
